<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ferres Car Hunter — Portal do Cliente</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0e0e0d;
      --card: #161513;
      --border: #2a2924;
      --gold: #c9a227;
      --gold-glow: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.2);
      --text: #f0f0f0;
      --muted: #888888;
      --green: #10b981;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 20px 12px;
    }
    .app-container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
    }
    .brand-header {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .brand-logo {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .brand-logo span { color: var(--gold); }
    .brand-sub {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }
    .client-card {
      background: #100f0e;
      border: 1px solid #22211d;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .info-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .info-label {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .info-value { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; }
    .car-tag { color: var(--gold); font-size: 13px; }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.15);
      color: var(--gold);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.3);
    }
    .progress-section {
      background: #100f0e;
      border: 1px solid #22211d;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .progress-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .progress-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .progress-pct { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--gold); }
    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 10px;
      background: #1e1d1a;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #2a2924;
    }
    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #967718, #c9a227);
      width: 60%;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--gold-glow);
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .timeline::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 7px;
      top: 6px;
      bottom: 6px;
      width: 2px;
      background: #262521;
    }
    .step { position: relative; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .step:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .step-dot {
      position: absolute;
      left: -24px;
      top: 2px;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #161513;
      border: 2px solid #44433d;
    }
    .step.completed .step-dot {
      background: var(--green);
      border-color: var(--green);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
    }
    .step.active .step-dot {
      background: var(--gold);
      border-color: var(--gold);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--gold-glow);
    }
    .step-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #888888; }
    .step.completed .step-name { color: #ffffff; }
    .step.active .step-name { color: var(--gold); }
    .step-desc { font-size: 11px; color: #666666; margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .step.active .step-desc { color: #aaaaaa; }
    .obs-box {
      background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.05);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .obs-header {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .obs-text { font-size: 12px; color: #dddddd; line-height: 1.4; }
    .app-footer {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #555555;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding-top: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #22211d;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-container">
  <div class="brand-header">
    <div class="brand-logo">FERRES <span>CAR HUNTER</span></div>
    <div class="brand-sub">Portal do Cliente • Busca em Tempo Real</div>
  </div>
  <div class="client-card">
    <div class="info-row">
      <span class="info-label">Cliente</span>
      <span class="info-value">Tamiris</span>
    </div>
    <div class="info-row">
      <span class="info-label">Carro-Alvo</span>
      <span class="info-value car-tag">Hyundai Creta Pulse 1.6 2018</span>
    </div>
    <div class="info-row">
      <span class="info-label">Vistoria</span>
      <span class="status-badge">Aguardando Vistoria</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-section">
    <div class="progress-header">
      <span class="progress-title">Progresso da Busca</span>
      <span class="progress-pct">60%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track">
      <div class="progress-fill"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-title">📌 Linha do Tempo do Processo</div>
  <div class="timeline">
    <div class="step completed">
      <div class="step-dot"></div>
      <div class="step-name">1 - Pesquisando</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Buscando opções no mercado conforme seu perfil e orçamento</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step completed">
      <div class="step-dot"></div>
      <div class="step-name">2 - Carro-alvo detectado</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Seleção de um veículo de alto potencial para análise técnica</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step active">
      <div class="step-dot"></div>
      <div class="step-name">3 - Vistoria agendada</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Inspeção presencial e laudo cautelar agendados</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-dot"></div>
      <div class="step-name">4 - Resultado da vistoria</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Aprovação técnica completa ou retomada da busca</div>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-dot"></div>
      <div class="step-name">5 - Negócio fechado</div>
      <div class="step-desc">Negociação final, pagamento e entrega do veículo</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="obs-box">
    <div class="obs-header">💬 Observação Tática / Próximo Passo</div>
    <div class="obs-text">
      Vistoria agendada para 10/08 às 14:00 em Santana. Vendedor confirmou presença no local.
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="app-footer">
    Ferres Car Hunter • Atualizado em tempo real
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
